 "summary_en": "Soite (Central Ostrobothnia) diagnoses lung cancer at the pulmonology clinic of Keski-Pohjanmaan keskussairaala in Kokkola and gives drug therapy at its own oncology clinic, which has three oncologists. Radiotherapy is given at OYS in Oulu or in Vaasa. In the OYS area's pathway, the university hospital runs the multidisciplinary meetings and does the surgery and radiotherapy, and every referral for suspected lung cancer is treated as urgent. I found no lung-cancer-specific decisions, projects, waiting-time figures or news from Soite.",
